      "article_id": "a1_b596fbeba3f3d3dc7f9063a5",
      "headline": "US strikes Iranian launchers on Larak Island in first known attack in weeks",
      "confirmed_facts": [
        {
          "fact_id": "f1",
          "text": "\"Air defense systems intercepted eight missiles that breached the Kingdom's airspace at dawn today, Monday,\" Jordan's armed forces said in a statement, quoting the army's spokesperson, reported by the state Petra News Agency.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-08-31T08:05:03.453048+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "a7ab9f4720b3cdb390d2bdcf34dda863091ba2739daced75fd5525ad5790fdcc",
          "excerpt": "\"Air defense systems intercepted eight missiles that breached the Kingdom's airspace at dawn today, Monday,\" Jordan's armed forces said in a statement, quoting the army's spokesperson, reported by the state Petra News Agency.",
          "sentence_hash": "3696cd5d69a97c9bb350ad8807414fc08349957af7d91b4d9dcc938da2cc44d9",
          "anchors": [
            "air"
          ]
        },
        {
          "fact_id": "f2",
          "text": "The US strike is the first known attack on Iran since President Donald Trump paused a renewed military campaign in late July.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-08-31T08:05:03.453088+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "a7ab9f4720b3cdb390d2bdcf34dda863091ba2739daced75fd5525ad5790fdcc",
          "excerpt": "The US strike is the first known attack on Iran since President Donald Trump paused a renewed military campaign in late July.",
          "sentence_hash": "d6340d2176956ffb15757c5efd631f3bf05b8de78a7ab5fe22e6f0e135e06b04",
          "anchors": [
            "us"
          ]
        },
        {
          "fact_id": "f3",
          "text": "Larak Island is just offshore from the key port of Bandar Abbas and sits right on the Strait of Hormuz, a vital waterway for global shipping.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-08-31T08:05:03.453144+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "a7ab9f4720b3cdb390d2bdcf34dda863091ba2739daced75fd5525ad5790fdcc",
          "excerpt": "Larak Island is just offshore from the key port of Bandar Abbas and sits right on the Strait of Hormuz, a vital waterway for global shipping.",
          "sentence_hash": "dd95582e2d86f60f5a8b1c97b4284b48b82aea3f17d93e35a662240894580143",
          "anchors": [
            "us"
          ]
        },
        {
          "fact_id": "f4",
          "text": "Iran is currently making tanker traffic pass by this island for checking and reportedly forcing vessels to pay $2m (Â£1.5m) to cross.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-08-31T08:05:03.453176+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "a7ab9f4720b3cdb390d2bdcf34dda863091ba2739daced75fd5525ad5790fdcc",
          "excerpt": "Iran is currently making tanker traffic pass by this island for checking and reportedly forcing vessels to pay $2m (Â£1.5m) to cross.",
          "sentence_hash": "4b61a5f5421efcd6239b6778d664cf91258a63699b04eb0ec87f18a2c21bdaf9",
          "anchors": [
            "$2"
          ]
        },
        {
          "fact_id": "f5",
          "text": "Hours later, Iranian media carried a statement by the IRGC saying it had attacked the US bases of King Hussein and al-Azraq in Jordan with ballistic missiles in response to the Larak Island attack.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-08-31T08:05:03.453229+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "a7ab9f4720b3cdb390d2bdcf34dda863091ba2739daced75fd5525ad5790fdcc",
          "excerpt": "Hours later, Iranian media carried a statement by the IRGC saying it had attacked the US bases of King Hussein and al-Azraq in Jordan with ballistic missiles in response to the Larak Island attack.",
          "sentence_hash": "03007dc2c86cadcacc98b4f3d705fe0e859e602f0bf3c420d00d80ca3c241489",
          "anchors": [
            "us"
          ]
        },
        {
          "fact_id": "f6",
          "text": "The IRGC said it had caused \"heavy damage\" and targeted \"technical infrastructure, maintenance facilities, and enemy fighter jet positions\", according to a translation from the AFP news agency.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-08-31T08:05:03.453261+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "a7ab9f4720b3cdb390d2bdcf34dda863091ba2739daced75fd5525ad5790fdcc",
          "excerpt": "The IRGC said it had caused \"heavy damage\" and targeted \"technical infrastructure, maintenance facilities, and enemy fighter jet positions\", according to a translation from the AFP news agency.",
          "sentence_hash": "d3b05d902fdfc5553346f67a0f50c3f7f5734a0842ab722374f4b33b4718a408",
          "anchors": [
            "us"
          ]
        }
